long (8 bytes)
The size of u is the maximum of these sizes which is 8
bytes.
Step-3 – The structure t contains the array a and the
union u.
The size of t is the sum of the sizes of a and u, which is
10+8=18 bytes.
The memory requirement for variable t is 18 bytes.

